  {
    "id": "src-20260726002931-b9da9d806a:chunk-0024",
    "ordinal": 24,
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "locator": "chunk 24",
    "text": "Examples: \nDetermine a series representation for \uD835\uDC53(\uD835\uDC65) = \uD835\uDC652ln\u2061(1 \u002B \uD835\uDC653)",
    "tokenCount": 9,
    "ocrConfidence": null
  },
  {
    "id": "src-20260726002931-b9da9d806a:chunk-0025",
    "ordinal": 25,
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "locator": "chunk 25",
    "text": "Find a degree-4 polynomial that may be used to approximate \uD835\uDC53(\uD835\uDC65) =\n\uD835\uDC652\n\u221A9\u002B\uD835\uDC65",
    "tokenCount": 12,
    "ocrConfidence": null
  },
  {
    "id": "src-20260726002931-b9da9d806a:chunk-0026",
    "ordinal": 26,
    "kind": "heading",
    "locator": "chunk 26",
    "text": "# PAGE 11\nPage 11 of 15",
    "tokenCount": 6,
    "ocrConfidence": null
  },
  {
    "id": "src-20260726002931-b9da9d806a:chunk-0027",
    "ordinal": 27,
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "locator": "chunk 27",
    "text": "If \uD835\uDC562 = \u22121, use series to show that \uD835\uDC52\uD835\uDC56\uD835\uDC65 = cos \uD835\uDC65 \u002B \uD835\uDC56 sin \uD835\uDC65.",
    "tokenCount": 10,
