    "tokenCount": 6,
    "ocrConfidence": null
  },
  {
    "id": "src-20260726002931-b9da9d806a:chunk-0029",
    "ordinal": 29,
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "locator": "chunk 29",
    "text": "Taylor Remainder and Estimation \nIf |\uD835\uDC53(\uD835\uDC5B\u002B1)(\uD835\uDC65)| \u2264 \uD835\uDC40 for |\uD835\uDC65 \u2212 \uD835\uDC4E| \u2264 \uD835\uDC51, then the remainder \uD835\uDC45\uD835\uDC5B(\uD835\uDC65) of the Taylor \nseries satisfies the inequality \n|\uD835\uDC45\uD835\uDC5B(\uD835\uDC65)| \u2264 \uD835\uDC40\n(\uD835\uDC5B \u002B 1)! |\uD835\uDC65 \u2212 \uD835\uDC4E|\uD835\uDC5B\u002B1",
    "tokenCount": 19,
    "ocrConfidence": null
  },
  {
    "id": "src-20260726002931-b9da9d806a:chunk-0030",
    "ordinal": 30,
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "locator": "chunk 30",
    "text": "Determine the number of terms of the series representation of \uD835\uDC53(\uD835\uDC65) = \uD835\uDC52 \uD835\uDC65 \nabout \uD835\uDC65 = 0\u2061to approximate \uD835\uDC520.1 accurate to within 0.00001.",
    "tokenCount": 21,
    "ocrConfidence": null
  },
  {
