  {
    "id": "src-20260726002931-b9da9d806a:chunk-0034",
    "ordinal": 34,
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "locator": "chunk 34",
    "text": "Let \uD835\uDC53(\uD835\uDC65) = \uD835\uDC653 \u2212 3\uD835\uDC65 \u002B 7.  Write \uD835\uDC53(\uD835\uDC65) as a Taylor series about \uD835\uDC4E = 1.  Use the \nTaylor series to find \uD835\uDC53(1.1).",
